From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:58:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: google,gs101-mbox: add gs201

The AP-to-APM mailbox of the Google gs201 (Tensor G2) SoC uses the same
register layout as gs101: Google's ACPM driver for gs201 rings the APM
with INTGR1 and masks the AP side with INTMR0, exactly as on gs101. Add
a gs201 compatible with the gs101 one as fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
index c109c1f7a..713a4e594 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
@@ -20,9 +20,13 @@ description:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - google,gs101-mbox
-      - samsung,exynos850-mbox
+    oneOf:
+      - enum:
+          - google,gs101-mbox
+          - samsung,exynos850-mbox
+      - items:
+          - const: google,gs201-mbox
+          - const: google,gs101-mbox
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
